              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅವನ ಮೇಲೆ ಅಜ್ಜನ ಪ್ರಭಾವ ಹೆಚ್ಚು. avana mēle ajjana prabhāva heccu. His grandfather's influence on him is strong."
