            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಾಧಿಸು — bādhisu — \"to affect badly\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬೆಲೆ ಏರಿಕೆ ಬಡವರನ್ನು ಹೆಚ್ಚು ಬಾಧಿಸಿತು. bele ērike baḍavarannu heccu bādhisitu. The rise in prices hit the poor hardest."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): ಬಾಧಿಸಿತು, bādhisitu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Who is affected takes -ಅನ್ನು. ಬಾಧೆ, distress."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಾಧಿಸು (bādhisu) is built on Sanskrit bādhana, \"oppressing, harassing\" (Monier-Williams), with the Kannada verb ending -isu."
            }
          ]
        },
